# One delivery appends its dead-letter record twice, as an in-call retry loop would.
MODULE: OneRecordPerDeliveryAppendRetried
TARGET: OneRecordPerDelivery
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a delivery appends two dead-letter records
PERTURBS: DeadLetter

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ dlq' = [dlq EXCEPT ![cur] = @ + 1]
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ dlq' = [dlq EXCEPT ![cur] = @ + 2]
--- END